meta {
  name: 04_PartyFilter
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Scenario: The party filter narrows the subject's list without widening it

    When a service owner lists a subject's parties filtered on a client main unit
    Then only that main unit is returned, without its subunits, since the filter is on the
    party and not on the hierarchy
    When the filter is on a subunit
    Then the subunit is returned nested under its main unit, which carries no access of its own
    When the filter is on a party the subject has no access to
    Then the request still succeeds and the list is empty
}
